{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31414","headline":"和柯古穷居苦日喜雨 · 韦蟾","name":"和柯古穷居苦日喜雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贞机澹少思，雅尚防多僻。\n揽葛犹不畏，劳形同处瘠。\n头焦讵是焚，背汗宁关炙。\n方欣见润础，那虞悲铄石。\n道与古人期，情难物外适。\n几怀朱邸绶，颇旷金门籍。\n清奥已萧萧，陈柯将槭槭。\n玉律诗调正，琼巵酒肠窄。\n衣桁袭中单，浴牀抛下綌。\n黎侯寓於卫，六义非凡格。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦蟾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}